          "briefTitle": "Stem Cell Mobilization Potential in Patients With Aplastic Anemia in Remission",
          "officialTitle": "A Pilot Study of G-CSF Induced Stem Cell Mobilization Potential in Patients With Relapsed Severe Aplastic Anemia"
        },
        "statusModule": {
